# Run the service, then send these in order. Synthetic data only.
@host = http://localhost:5020

### What the server supports
GET {{host}}/fhir/metadata

### Which services need authorization, and their paperwork
GET {{host}}/requirements

### Submit a request. Expect outcome "queued" and review action A4 (Pended).
POST {{host}}/fhir/Claim/$submit
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

< ../../prototype/PriorAuth.Prototype/sample-pas-request.json

### Now open {{host}}/ in a browser and decide the request.

### Ask for the current state. Expect the reviewer's decision.
POST {{host}}/fhir/Claim/$inquire
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

< ../../prototype/PriorAuth.Prototype/sample-pas-request.json

### The reviewer queue as JSON
GET {{host}}/internal/requests
